awn agent resolution: Agent selection: claude via explicit_override\nspawn launch composition: degraded_contract_unavailable; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=claude; schema=1; diagnostic=composition_contract_unavailable; bare child launch retained\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (claude) (run=RUN-260728-e41666, max_parallel=20)\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (claude) (run=RUN-260728-e41666)\nRework cycle 1 complete: all five blocking reviewer findings addressed in the same task worktree /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-1g0z69/curator-spec-worktree. Delta versus the accepted predecessor is still exactly decisions/0007-compiled-build-toolchain-preflight.md, docs/compiled-build-toolchain-requirements.md, one CHANGELOG bullet. Nothing staged, committed, published, pinned; no platform validation claimed. Predecessor TASK-260728-2kp3tv worktree preserved read-only (127 dirty entries at 57c1f56, nothing staged).\n\n(1) Go family gate preserved. New REQUIRED registry field compatibility: a closed manager-owned set of tested release families matched by exact set membership, never ordering. go = {(1,23)}, carrying profiles/manager.md 2.2 forward unchanged. Independent of the requirement - a constraint can neither widen nor narrow it and nothing on the wire surface reaches it. New twelfth diagnostic build_toolchain_untested_release carrying the admitted family set. Stage A gains step 7 with fixed precedence: Go 1.22.0 -\u003e incompatible (step 6), Go 1.99.0 -\u003e untested_release (step 7), so at_least alone admits nothing. Vectors 7 preserve, 31 reject, 32 precedence, 57 identical cache key.\n\n(2) Guidance totality mechanical. reason is exactly the diagnostic code suffix, so the code-to-reason mapping is the identity and stays total as codes are added; the five uncovered reasons plus untested_release are covered. New guidance_class (host/configuration/authoring) fixes the admissible primary_source origin per clas